<title>HONG KONG: Midland Realty 1996 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Midland Realty 1996 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   130.0    vs 44.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    39.5     vs 13.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    300.01   vs 77.54</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,303.96 vs 482.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 Midland Realty (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 16-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Midland Realty is a property agency.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of three-for-two shares held.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 52 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 12.5 cents) vs 13.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
